Draws the card view from the row uischema, so the toggle switches the frame but
not the declaration — the card becomes a re-labelled table row and the
scenario's second declaration goes unread.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the card-view specs — card view renders `presentation.card`, slots and
all.

